## Summary

### Spec 031 - Provider Fallback Chain ✅
- Fixed a failing test in `fallback.test.ts` by removing the `isRetryableError` dependency (fallback should be more conservative than retry)
- Implementation allows automatic failover to alternative AI providers when the primary fails
- Auth errors don't trigger fallback; availability errors do
- Settings UI allows reordering providers and configuring API keys per provider
- "Generated via {provider}" indicator shows which provider ultimately succeeded

### Spec 040 - Keyboard Shortcuts ✅
- Created `useKeyboardShortcuts` hook with platform-aware modifier key detection
- Implemented shortcuts:
  - `Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+G`: Generate all descriptions
  - `Cmd/Ctrl+F`: Focus search field  
  - `Escape`: Close settings/export modal
- Added shortcut hints in tooltips and placeholders
- 13 new tests for the keyboard shortcuts utilities

